{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "cf0dd47e34bc4221a003b727fa4728edb66ca02e1dbe7bb301faab78a4997a91", "ja": "天使たちの行進", "zh": "天使们的游行", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0d3de73de9ea85ac07f80be326846edd2f4009368205d20a630c712109a2486d", "ja": "公演直前になって、翼が突然、ダンスの振り\n付けのチェンジを提案する。その方が楽しそ\nうだと言うメンバーを信頼し、プロデューサ\nーはゴーサインを出す。会場中を笑顔にさせ\nる、輝きのパレードの幕開けだ！", "zh": "在公演即将开始前，翼突然提议改变舞蹈\n动作，因为成员们说这样会让表演更加欢乐，\n制作人基于对她们的信赖而同意了。\n让整个会场展露笑容的闪耀游行就此登场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0be9cb6a5fd389cc37c0e4ad8d625c394cb0d7a9ae84764f00115c0f292e35ac", "ja": "（いよいよ、ANGEL STARSの公演が始まる。\nまずは新曲からのスタートだ）", "zh": "（『ANGEL STARS』的公演终于要开始了，\n首先是以新歌开场。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2a17dd617454db7cf58c4c3db0ec7af9435db81fcbfe89d396e5ae0b0beeded5", "ja": "（準備万端、この調子なら最高のスタートを\n切れる……と、思っていたのだが……）", "zh": "（准备万全，这样就能有个完美的开场……\n我原本是这样想的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "19f8a10a08b3069ec3a8843775458e577ddbdffc97ea7dff96c79740ac85ef59", "ja": "え……サビのダンスをアレンジしたい？\nこの土壇場にか？", "zh": "咦……想调整副歌的舞蹈？\n在这个关头？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "aba3e08d09b4223c5356513baa9dfff7854cddc602654728494af6873e72d819", "ja": "ちょっと手の動きを変えるだけですってば～。\nでも、新曲に入れたら絶対カワイイなって♪", "zh": "就说只是改一下手部动作嘛～\n但感觉加到新歌里一定会很可爱的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1f5d235dcb81945a9dc477d62d6439dd81f5de940a9e576ab87f6986106e8b2b", "ja": "みんなにも聞いたら、やりたいって！\nねぇいいでしょ、{$P$}さ～ん。", "zh": "问了大家，大家也有这个意愿！\n可以吧，{$P$}先生～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4af0e83bfc441c1c131715cafa7d6aa49a660131be8cad6d7e7c87b76ae761f6", "ja": "えっ？\n翼、もう、みんなと相談してきたのか？", "zh": "咦？\n翼，你已经跟大家讨论过了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b1833bd0eb24e6f6e6dff07786dbca7aaca1aa4b8968024858c972d825250d99", "ja": "はい！　……あれ？　{$P$}さんより\n先に聞いちゃったら、ダメでしたか？", "zh": "对呀……咦？不能在问{$P$}先生\n之前先问大家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "804a4dbc7a58841966e8d2b3fcf43c8a57faabe6172e5752ffcd4d6e2b9b3450", "ja": "いや、そうじゃないけど……。", "zh": "不，不是这个问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "264095c4c8807f7f3f556dd73f73bb38ee20e42eb3e30f683bde7e9d62a7cce9", "ja": "はい、練習もしました！　とってもかわいくて\nステキだったので……できるなら、やってみたいです！", "zh": "是的，我们也练习过了！因为非常可爱\n又好看……可以的话我想试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "4c764c95be124423a0d04bd0a31fddaa4eefc7302611315ace628d96a2c14e38", "ja": "うん……。\n杏奈も、やってみたい……！", "zh": "嗯……\n杏奈也想试试看……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "90c75438efa7d64cbb37deb599a17698dd91881d21d15c19f24d233e677ea6fd", "ja": "みんな元気いっぱい、やる気いっぱいだね♪\nもちろん、私もやってみたいです！", "zh": "大家都充满活力和干劲呢♪\n当然，我也想试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6715954760bc3dd8a2816c8210a4ffc75b6404f33fbe5c6935f6233908633225", "ja": "歌織さんは、不安ですか？", "zh": "歌织小姐觉得不安吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "d9987ae7c29c527ec736d99350208c870bfb065b068eaef7bdde4dd8d985072b", "ja": "はい……、ごめんなさい、少しだけ。\nダンスは得意なほうではありませんから。でも……。", "zh": "是的……抱歉，有一点点。\n因为我不擅长跳舞，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "4462c3cbcfb1f77411c9019693d1bd5750e50bc60d6986f1027c95344529bc67", "ja": "きっとステージは素敵になると思います。\nですから……。私、挑戦してみたいです！", "zh": "表演一定会变得更棒的，\n所以……我想挑战看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_1015", "source_sha256": "e270ec23d5b6ff96972f8f7ce419fa9a68cfadaff85b8bd73e39c0e874c4c578", "ja": "よし！", "zh": "好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_2000_p", "source_sha256": "9025f02b3e37928ad8943c97339ab31315d4e1d298f6bbd9602659fbf096e25e", "ja": "よし！　今のみんなは自分達のこと、\nちゃんとわかってるからな。任せる！", "zh": "好！因为现在各位已经很了解自己了，\n那就交给你们啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_2001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "239221f05d7371eb50a7de2470365c5aca7af7c157b04e6ad9176a03e43d1511", "ja": "やった～♪　さすが{$P$}さん、\n話がわかりますね～！", "zh": "太好了～♪不愧是{$P$}先生，\n很通情达理呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_2002_p", "source_sha256": "f042076ce3d9cd85a5f77082643d174d0583d890d6aebfc1e84718a34aaa015a", "ja": "そのかわり、だ！\nみんなにひとつ、約束してもらおうかな。", "zh": "但有条件！\n大家跟我约定一件事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_2003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "74b8e4f0a5e3022700f04dd55214eef20f7fe44ead49630396ac6a93e16ef7ee", "ja": "えっ……な、なんですか？\n厳しいのとか、イヤですよ～……？", "zh": "咦……是、是什么呢？\n如果很严肃的话我可不要喔……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_2004_p", "source_sha256": "35fcbe304f5f48ebdafcbded8b7de08d309853f3c1b28224250e9d4b8ac4c266", "ja": "いや、たいしたことじゃないよ。\nただ……。", "zh": "不，不是什么大事，\n只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_2005", "source_sha256": "5eafd2608149039778955c6e28d10145548e4b329e6955d311f11d2a81dd21a0", "ja": "後悔しないこと", "zh": "不要后悔", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_3000_p", "source_sha256": "7a6cdf11bc60f0e46c3911d2653017015d5157f9ec1c45793039d10f168d6ad0", "ja": "やると決めたからには、後悔しないこと。\n最後まで、このパーティーを楽しむこと！　いいな？", "zh": "既然决定要做，就不要后悔。\n要享受这场盛宴到最后！可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_3001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7844f96cf52285aaa2a7b8d65e3708e4e256fd0f225ed9d4513351653ffce442", "ja": "……な～んだ。\nわたし、怒られるのかと思っちゃった！", "zh": "……什么嘛～\n我还以为要被骂了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_3002_024ann", "source_sha256": "7e88eeac5f13b891ae4c4f89218b70e6b7bab43217c94a7e81627b3775b65842", "ja": "ん……。杏奈、約束……します。\n最後まで……楽しむ、って……！", "zh": "嗯……杏奈……答应你。\n要享受……到最后……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_3003_022ser", "source_sha256": "e4d0ccd281481cadb08cc0b9de9590db942d979a064a53e5b7773360128b9a79", "ja": "わたしもですっ。もし失敗しても……。\n楽しく笑顔で、がんばります！", "zh": "我也是，就算失败了……\n也要开心地笑着，继续加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_3004_p", "source_sha256": "85647cd38b70b301f53270b2de4cb975730625ae96a55bd23821759851568600", "ja": "よし、その意気だ！　準備はいいな？\nみんなの笑顔を、劇場中にふりまいてこい！", "zh": "好，很棒的决心！准备好了吗？\n把你们的笑容传到剧场的每个角落吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_3005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d", "ja": "は～い！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_3006_022ser", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_3007_052kao", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_3008_024ann", "source_sha256": "059c5ca157b74d3dc1381c3605e2d380c6963c4411791c40a7cba5647fa45b3e", "ja": "はい……♪", "zh": "好的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_3009_048rei", "source_sha256": "d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c", "ja": "はーい♪", "zh": "好的──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_3010_p", "source_sha256": "109ce9332f077bcec1c505983a0918addbde7f61e32035cdec4d418f6265ee12", "ja": "（駆け出していくアイドル達は、やがて\nまばゆい光と、歓声に包み込まれていく）", "zh": "（飞奔而出的偶像们，\n逐渐被闪耀夺目的光芒与欢呼声包围。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0014_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_06_3011_p", "source_sha256": "b59d3ed0bcf2fcb1e9bcbb0cf01947748fabf84db5055f64bf36dcd0a2d35ec4", "ja": "（劇場に住む天使たちの、輝きのパレード。\nさあ、空に向かって行進開始だ！）", "zh": "（住在剧场中的天使们，就此展开闪耀游行。\n来吧，朝着天空开始前进！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
